<Legal title="Delete your myboutiki account" path="/delete-account/" description="How to delete your myboutiki account and data.">
<h2>Delete from the app or website</h2>
<ol><li>Log in to myboutiki (app or myboutiki.com).</li><li>Open your Profile and tap the menu (☰).</li><li>Tap <b>Delete account</b> and confirm.</li></ol>
<p>Your account is deleted immediately.</p>
<h2>Delete by email</h2><p>If you can't log in, email <a href="mailto:support@myboutiki.com?subject=Delete%20my%20account">support@myboutiki.com</a> from the email address of your account with the subject "Delete my account". We delete it within 7 days.</p>
<h2>What gets deleted</h2><p>Your shops, posts and photos, highlights, followers and following, messages and voice messages, verification ID images, and your sign-in account. Payment records may be kept for up to 5 years where the law requires it.</p>
<div class="ar"><h2>حذف الحساب</h2><p>من التطبيق أو الموقع: الملف الشخصي ← القائمة ← حذف الحساب ثم التأكيد. أو راسلنا من بريد حسابك على support@myboutiki.com بعنوان «حذف حسابي». يتم حذف المتجر والمنشورات والصور والمتابعين والرسائل وصور التوثيق وحساب الدخول.</p></div>
</Legal>
